	)
	(text
		"DCC from the rails is a bipolar square wave: rectify, buffer, step down to 5 V.\nC1 also carries the board through each RailCom cutout (~0.5 ms, rails at 0 V).\nIN- and OUT- of a non-isolated module are the same node, so GND is tied to the\nrails via the bridge: never plug in USB while powered from the rails."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 27.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "89f02fb5-2b70-470a-89d9-b80cc45835c8")
	)
